        },
        {
          "children": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "The primary goal of the project is to build efficiencies by automating IVR calls, allowing associates to focus on more complex tasks rather than mundane activities like checking claim statuses.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
                  "object": "block",
                  "type": "transcript",
                  "data": {
                    "uuid": "deb68e55-860e-4672-8db5-51cd0784e09b",
                    "time": 201.68,
                    "highlight_note_list_item": true,
                    "turing_note": true,
                    "model": "v11"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Chirag Patel mentioned that the current volume of calls is around 50,000 per month, with approximately 30-40% being IVR calls, and the average time spent on an IVR call is 5-6 minutes.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
                  "object": "block",
                  "type": "transcript",
                  "data": {
                    "uuid": "19647b43-abfe-4ce9-b5ea-812c98279edd",
                    "time": 392.42,
                    "highlight_note_list_item": true,
                    "turing_note": true,
                    "model": "v11"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "The team is considering the cost-effectiveness of transitioning to an automated system, factoring in the cost of API calls and software tools against current employee costs, which range from 20k to 40k based on experience.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
                  "object": "block",
                  "type": "transcript",
                  "data": {
                    "uuid": "fa568501-be5b-4732-aeb9-f3f1a742cc46",
                    "time": 423.34,
                    "highlight_note_list_item": true,
                    "turing_note": true,
                    "model": "v11"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Chirag Patel highlighted the need for the bot to handle different IVR structures from various insurance companies and to manage processing delays effectively, ensuring it mimics human interaction.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
                  "object": "block",
                  "type": "transcript",
                  "data": {
                    "uuid": "2672a62f-9972-499c-9be7-ae98f8382f28",
                    "time": 804.24005,
                    "highlight_note_list_item": true,
                    "turing_note": true,
                    "model": "v11"
                  }
                }
              ],
              "object": "block",
              "type": "list-item",
              "data": {}
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "A follow-up email will be sent by Bharath MVS with tentative costing and POC details, and a placeholder meeting is set for Tuesday at 8 PM to discuss further steps.",
                      "object": "text",
                      "marks": []
                    }
                  ],
                  "object": "block",
